Subject: [PATCH v11 11/36] afs: Use a bvecq to hold dir content rather than folioq
Date: Wed,  2 Sep 2026 18:33:23 +0100
Message-ID: <20260902173350.3468672-12-dhowells@redhat.com>
In-Reply-To: <20260902173350.3468672-1-dhowells@redhat.com>
References: <20260902173350.3468672-1-dhowells@redhat.com>
Precedence: bulk
X-Mailing-List: v9fs@lists.linux.dev
List-Id: <v9fs.lists.linux.dev>
List-Subscribe: <mailto:v9fs+subscribe@lists.linux.dev>
List-Unsubscribe: <mailto:v9fs+unsubscribe@lists.linux.dev>
MIME-Version: 1.0
X-Scanned-By: MIMEDefang 3.6 on 10.30.177.95
X-Mimecast-MFC-PROC-ID: hvWhfjJ25TBpNTI7tWX4Ra9CpFuF2jv0BPCDf95Eq-E_1788370536
